<p id="S3.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.I5.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, a homeomorphism of stratified spaces</p>
