<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="0" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3.6)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="S3.Thmthm24.p1.2" class="ltx_p">These objects need to satisfy the following conditions.</p>
<ol id="S3.I14" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S3.I14.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(A)</span> 
<div id="S3.I14.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I14.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.I14.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=q</annotation></semantics></math>, the space <math id="S3.I14.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{U}}_{pp}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{U}}_{pp}</annotation></semantics></math> is a singleton with trivial isotropy and <math id="S3.I14.ix1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{E}}_{pp}=\{0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{E}}_{pp}=\{0\}</annotation></semantics></math> is the trivial bundle.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I14.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(B)</span> 
<div id="S3.I14.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I14.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chart embeddings satisfy the associativity. More precisely, whenever <math id="S3.I14.ix2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;r&lt;s&lt;q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;r&lt;s&lt;q</annotation></semantics></math>, the following diagram commutes.</p>
<table id="S3.Ex64" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="108.66" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-98.51168807618133px" version="1.1" viewBox="45.73 98.51 352.61 108.66" width="352.61"><g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 45.73139524796337 108.65879335953714) translate(0,3.46) translate(45.73,0)"><g transform="translate(78.94,0) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.87em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="95.04"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{C_{pr}\times C_{rs}\times C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{C_{pr}\times C_{rs}\times C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 165.38665125408625 -11.569253138458645 L 165.4089260879882 -11.624338485994361" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(182.67,0) translate(0,-13.47) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.67em;--ltx-fo-height:0.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.73)" width="37.01"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\rm id}\times{\bm{\iota}}_{rsq}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">id</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\rm id}\times{\bm{\iota}}_{rsq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(230.23,0) translate(0,-33.13)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -5.69 4.81" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -7.44 -0.44" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 165.38665125408625 -11.569253138458645 L 230.2232243237166 -33.131904649556354" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 230.20094948981466 -33.07432789879748 L 230.2232243237166 -33.131904649556354" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 95.82428742827462 -11.569253138458645 L 95.80838889753701 -11.569253138458645" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(32.97,0) translate(0,-13.47) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.7em;--ltx-fo-height:0.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 6.73)" width="37.32"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{prs}\times{\rm id}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">id</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{prs}\times{\rm id}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(30.97,0) translate(0,-33.13)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 7.44 -0.44" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 5.69 4.81" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 95.82428742827462 -11.569253138458645 L 30.973040415931575 -33.131904649556354" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 30.98891783308254 -33.131904649556354 L 30.973040415931575 -33.131904649556354" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(-45.73,0) translate(0,-43.43) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.01em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.57" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="83.16"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\partial^{prs}C_{ps}\times C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\partial^{prs}C_{ps}\times C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 34.71905518422668 -55.00203332284748 L 34.75872761351745 -55.10329408435813" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(46.86,0) translate(0,-72.79) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-0.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="19.35"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{psq}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{psq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(100.2,0) translate(0,-76.85)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -5.69 4.81" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -7.44 -0.44" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 34.71905518422668 -55.00203332284748 L 100.20330863753114 -76.84610783022866" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 100.20330863753114 -76.70340109814974 L 100.20330863753114 -76.84610783022866" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(215.49,0) translate(0,-43.43) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.57" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="83.09"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{C_{pr}\times\partial^{rsq}C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.055em">×</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{C_{pr}\times\partial^{rsq}C_{rq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 226.4671383745957 -55.00203332284748 L 226.46350683769415 -55.021647844833176" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(186.58,0) translate(0,-72.79) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-0.72)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.42em;--ltx-fo-height:0.3em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="6.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 4.17)" width="19.6"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{prq}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}_{prq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(161.02,0) translate(0,-76.82)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 7.44 -0.44" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 5.69 4.81" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 226.4671383745957 -55.00203332284748 L 161.0189469272671 -76.81640101383051" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 161.0189469272671 -76.78924894141544 L 161.0189469272671 -76.81640101383051" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(100.2,0) translate(0,-86.94) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.8em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.57" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="52.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex64.m1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\partial^{prsq}C_{pq}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\partial^{prsq}C_{pq}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I14.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(C)</span> 
<div id="S3.I14.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="pq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">pq</annotation></semantics></math> and all <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\alpha=pr_{1}\cdots r_{l}q\in{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msub><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝔸</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=pr_{1}\cdots r_{l}q\in{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, define</p>
<table id="S3.Ex65" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex65.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="C_{\alpha}:=C_{pr_{1}}\times\cdots\times C_{r_{l}q}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo><mo lspace="0.055em" rspace="0.055em">⋯</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\alpha}:=C_{pr_{1}}\times\cdots\times C_{r_{l}q}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Then condition (B) implies that for each pair of elements <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\leq\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\leq\beta</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝔸</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math>, there is a well-defined chart embedding</p>
<table id="S3.Ex66" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}:C_{\alpha}\hookrightarrow\partial^{\alpha}C_{\beta}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">↪</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mi>α</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}:C_{\alpha}\hookrightarrow\partial^{\alpha}C_{\beta}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Then we require that the collection <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{C_{\alpha}\}_{\alpha\in{\mathbb{A}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><msubsup><mi>𝔸</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{C_{\alpha}\}_{\alpha\in{\mathbb{A}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}}</annotation></semantics></math> of derived orbifold presentations and the collection <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}\}_{\alpha\leq\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}\}_{\alpha\leq\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> of chart embeddings constitute a system derived orbifold presentations of <math id="S3.I14.ix3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I14.ix4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(D)</span> 
<div id="S3.I14.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The strict <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Pi</annotation></semantics></math>-equivariance condition: for any <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a\in\Pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a\in\Pi</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;q</annotation></semantics></math>, there is an isomorphism between derived orbifold charts (in the obvious sense) <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\phi}_{a}:C_{pq}\to C_{a\cdot p\ a\cdot q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.410em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\phi}_{a}:C_{pq}\to C_{a\cdot p\ a\cdot q}</annotation></semantics></math> satisfying <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\phi}_{a_{1}\cdot a_{2}}=\tilde{\phi}_{a_{1}}\circ\tilde{\phi}_{a_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\phi}_{a_{1}\cdot a_{2}}=\tilde{\phi}_{a_{1}}\circ\tilde{\phi}_{a_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\phi}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\phi}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> restricts to <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> along the zero locus <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{S}}_{pq}^{-1}(0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{S}}_{pq}^{-1}(0)</annotation></semantics></math> to the map <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\phi_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\phi_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> from Definition <a href="#S3.Thmthm7" title="Definition 3.7. ‣ 3.2. Topological flow categories and bimodules ‣ 3. Abstract constructions of chain complexes and maps over the integers ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.7</span></a>. Furthermore, <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{\phi}_{0}={\rm Id}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Id</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{\phi}_{0}={\rm Id}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S3.I14.ix4.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a=0\in\Pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a=0\in\Pi</annotation></semantics></math> should be the identity map.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS4.SSS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS4.SSS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Now consider derived orbifold lifts of bimodules.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.Thmthm25" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_defn">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="S3.Thmthm25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 3.25</span></span><span id="S3.Thmthm25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="S3.Thmthm25.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> be a flow bimodule from a flow category <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>T</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>T</mi><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> as in Definition <a href="#S3.Thmthm10" title="Definition 3.10. ‣ 3.2.1. Flow bimodules ‣ 3.2. Topological flow categories and bimodules ‣ 3. Abstract constructions of chain complexes and maps over the integers ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.10</span></a>. Suppose <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>T</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> resp. <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>T</mi><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> is endowed with a derived orbifold lift</p>
<table id="S3.Ex67" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex67.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\mathfrak{D}}^{\mathcal{P}}=\Big(\big\{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}=({\mathcal{U}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},{\mathcal{E}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},{\mathcal{S}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},\psi^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq})\big\}_{p&lt;q},\big\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}^{\mathcal{P}}\big\}_{\alpha\leq\beta}\Big)\text{ resp. }" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝔇</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mtext> resp. </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathfrak{D}}^{\mathcal{P}}=\Big(\big\{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}=({\mathcal{U}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},{\mathcal{E}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},{\mathcal{S}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq},\psi^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq})\big\}_{p&lt;q},\big\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta\alpha}^{\mathcal{P}}\big\}_{\alpha\leq\beta}\Big)\text{ resp. }</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="S3.Ex68" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex68.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="{\mathfrak{D}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}=\Big(\big\{C^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}}=({\mathcal{U}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},{\mathcal{E}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},{\mathcal{S}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},\psi^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}})\big\}_{p^{\prime}&lt;q^{\prime}},\big\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta^{\prime}\alpha^{\prime}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}\big\}_{\alpha^{\prime}\leq\beta^{\prime}}\Big)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝔇</mi><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><msup><mi>β</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>β</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathfrak{D}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}=\Big(\big\{C^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}}=({\mathcal{U}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},{\mathcal{E}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},{\mathcal{S}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}},\psi^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{p^{\prime}q^{\prime}})\big\}_{p^{\prime}&lt;q^{\prime}},\big\{{\bm{\iota}}_{\beta^{\prime}\alpha^{\prime}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}\big\}_{\alpha^{\prime}\leq\beta^{\prime}}\Big).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.2" class="ltx_p">A <span id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">derived orbifold lift</span> of <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">compatible with (or extending)</span> <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathfrak{D}}^{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝔇</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathfrak{D}}^{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathfrak{D}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝔇</mi><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathfrak{D}}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> consists of the following objects.</p>
<ol id="S3.I15" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S3.I15.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="S3.I15.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I15.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A collection</p>
<table id="S3.Ex69" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex69.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\big\{C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}=({\mathcal{U}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},{\mathcal{E}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},{\mathcal{S}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},\psi^{M}_{pp^{\prime}})\big\}_{p\in{\mathcal{P}},p^{\prime}\in{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>ψ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\big\{C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}=({\mathcal{U}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},{\mathcal{E}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},{\mathcal{S}}^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},\psi^{M}_{pp^{\prime}})\big\}_{p\in{\mathcal{P}},p^{\prime}\in{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I15.i1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">of derived orbifold presentations of <math id="S3.I15.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{pp^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{pp^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S3.I15.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{pp^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{pp^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> as an <math id="S3.I15.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathbb{A}}_{pp^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝔸</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathbb{A}}_{pp^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math>-space such that for each connected component <math id="S3.I15.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}\subset{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime}}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo>⊂</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}\subset{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime}}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math>, one has</p>
<table id="S3.E7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\rm dim}_{\mathbb{R}}{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}-{\rm rank}_{\mathbb{R}}{\mathcal{E}}_{pp^{\prime}}^{M}|_{{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}}\equiv{\rm ind}^{\mathcal{P}}(p)-{\rm ind}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}(p^{\prime})\ {\rm mod}\ 2N." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>dim</mi><mi>ℝ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>rank</mi><mi>ℝ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></msub></mrow><mo>≡</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>ind</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msup><mi>ind</mi><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>mod</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn> 2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\rm dim}_{\mathbb{R}}{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}-{\rm rank}_{\mathbb{R}}{\mathcal{E}}_{pp^{\prime}}^{M}|_{{\mathcal{U}}_{pp^{\prime},j}^{M}}\equiv{\rm ind}^{\mathcal{P}}(p)-{\rm ind}^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}(p^{\prime})\ {\rm mod}\ 2N.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3.7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I15.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="S3.I15.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I15.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given <math id="S3.I15.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\in{\mathcal{P}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\in{\mathcal{P}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.I15.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p^{\prime}\in{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p^{\prime}\in{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="S3.I15.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{pp^{\prime}}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{pp^{\prime}}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, for any <math id="S3.I15.i2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p\leq q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p\leq q</annotation></semantics></math>, a chart embedding</p>
<table id="S3.Ex70" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex70.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pqp^{\prime}}:C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}\times C^{M}_{qp^{\prime}}\hookrightarrow\partial^{pqp^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">↪</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pqp^{\prime}}:C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}\times C^{M}_{qp^{\prime}}\hookrightarrow\partial^{pqp^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I15.i2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">and for any <math id="S3.I15.i2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}\leq p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}\leq p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, a chart embedding</p>
<table id="S3.Ex71" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex71.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}:C^{M}_{pq^{\prime}}\times C^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{q^{\prime}p^{\prime}}\hookrightarrow\partial^{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">↪</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}:C^{M}_{pq^{\prime}}\times C^{{\mathcal{P}}^{\prime}}_{q^{\prime}p^{\prime}}\hookrightarrow\partial^{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I15.i2.p1.3" class="ltx_p">The precise meaning can be spelled out as in Equation (<a href="#S3.E6" title="In item 2 ‣ Definition 3.24. ‣ 3.4.4. Derived orbifold lifts of flow categories and bimodules ‣ 3.4. Derived orbifold charts with stratifications ‣ 3. Abstract constructions of chain complexes and maps over the integers ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.6</span></a>).</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="S3.Thmthm25.p1.3" class="ltx_p">These objects are required to satisfy the following conditions.</p>
<ol id="S3.I16" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S3.I16.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(A)</span> 
<div id="S3.I16.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p=q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p=q</annotation></semantics></math>, the chart embedding <math id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\iota}}_{pqp^{\prime}}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\iota}}_{pqp^{\prime}}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math> is the identity map after identifying <math id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math> with the trivial chart for the singleton. Similarly, for <math id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}=p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}=p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, the chart embedding <math id="S3.I16.ix1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{\iota}}_{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝜾</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{\iota}}_{pq^{\prime}p^{\prime}}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math> is also the identity map.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I16.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(B)</span> 
<div id="S3.I16.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I16.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The chart embeddings satisfy the associativity. Namely, given <math id="S3.I16.ix2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{pp^{\prime}}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{pp^{\prime}}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, the following three diagrams commute if the relevant topological spaces are nonempty.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.I16.ix2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;q_{1}&lt;q_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;q_{1}&lt;q_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
<table id="S3.Ex72" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="118.26" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-105.9293344470497px" version="1.1" viewBox="58.73 105.93 434.18 118.26" width="434.18"><g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 58.726005506693646 118.26123144842043) translate(0,3.46) translate(58.73,0)"><g transform="translate(91.94,0) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:8.73em;--ltx-fo-height:0.84em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.37em;font-size:10pt;" height="16.78" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 11.64)" width="120.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}}\times C^{\mathcal{P}}_{q_{1}q_{2}}\times C^{M}_{q_{2}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}}\times C^{\mathcal{P}}_{q_{1}q_{2}}\times C^{M}_{q_{2}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 200.13733459109503 -12.746990114652519 L 200.18127196488646 -12.855218359753355" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(212.63,0) translate(0,-11.73) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.75em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.9)" width="51.95"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\rm id}\times{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{q_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">id</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\rm id}\times{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{q_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(267.84,0) translate(0,-32.51)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -5.87 4.6" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -7.42 -0.72" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 200.13733459109503 -12.746990114652519 L 267.8411538396054 -32.50846266334146" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 267.79721646581396 -32.403802614382265 L 267.8411538396054 -32.50846266334146" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 113.3482687467029 -12.746990114652519 L 113.3482687467029 -12.746990114652519" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(40.9,0) translate(0,-13.01) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2.71)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.48em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.34" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.88)" width="48.21"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}q_{2}}\times{\rm id}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.710em">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">id</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}q_{2}}\times{\rm id}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(41.74,0) translate(0,-33.91)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 7.42 -0.69" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 5.85 4.62" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 113.3482687467029 -12.746990114652519 L 41.7405684426132 -33.909116887247905" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 41.7405684426132 -33.909116887247905 L 41.7405684426132 -33.909116887247905" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(-58.73,0) translate(0,-46.24) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.89em;--ltx-fo-height:0.84em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.37em;font-size:10pt;" height="16.78" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 11.64)" width="109.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\partial^{pq_{1}q_{2}}C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{2}}\times C^{M}_{q_{2}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\partial^{pq_{1}q_{2}}C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{2}}\times C^{M}_{q_{2}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 42.48581471013647 -58.98800400327115 L 42.52384027966956 -59.11354538941426" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(54,0) translate(0,-80.61) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.09em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.9)" width="28.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq_{2}p^{\prime}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq_{2}p^{\prime}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(114.65,0) translate(0,-80.68)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -5.83 4.64" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -7.42 -0.66" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 42.48581471013647 -58.98800400327115 L 114.64605757651428 -80.67706255756408" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 114.64605757651428 -80.5004685189329 L 114.64605757651428 -80.67706255756408" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(254.26,0) translate(0,-46.24) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:8.16em;--ltx-fo-height:0.94em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.37em;font-size:10pt;" height="18.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 13.04)" width="112.89"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}}\times\partial^{q_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{q_{1}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.055em">×</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{C^{\mathcal{P}}_{pq_{1}}\times\partial^{q_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{q_{1}p^{\prime}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 271.8504128060896 -58.98800400327115 L 271.8504128060896 -58.98800400327115" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(222.57,0) translate(0,-80.61) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-2.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.09em;--ltx-fo-height:0.64em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.33em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.49" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.9)" width="28.97"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq_{1}p^{\prime}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.700em">𝜾</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{{\bm{\iota}}^{M}_{pq_{1}p^{\prime}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(198.34,0) translate(0,-80.76)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 7.42 -0.68" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 5.84 4.62" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 271.8504128060896 -58.98800400327115 L 198.34162404762523 -80.75879325143559" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 198.395252557683 -80.75879325143559 L 198.34162404762523 -80.75879325143559" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(114.65,0) translate(0,-93.18) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.45em;--ltx-fo-height:0.94em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.37em;font-size:10pt;" height="18.18" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 13.04)" width="75.39"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex72.m1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{\partial^{pq_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}.}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow></msup><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{\partial^{pq_{1}q_{2}p^{\prime}}C^{M}_{pp^{\prime}}.}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{2}^{\prime}&lt;q_{1}^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{2}^{\prime}&lt;q_{1}^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
