<p id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.3" class="ltx_p">Finally, for <math id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;q</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S3.I16.ix2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{\prime}&lt;p^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</p>
