mi></msup><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔽</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>𝔽</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔽</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>𝔽</mi><mi>γ</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}|_{\partial^{\alpha}{\mathcal{U}}_{\beta}}\times[0,\epsilon)^{{\mathbb{F}}_{\alpha}\setminus{\mathbb{F}}_{\beta}}\times\{0\}^{{\mathbb{F}}_{\beta}\setminus{\mathbb{F}}_{\gamma}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 103.79686219672107 -91.35813044696754 L 103.79686219672107 -90.80465888686739" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(127.52,0) translate(0,-80.22) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.72em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.99)" width="31.35"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex94.m1.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{\gamma\alpha}^{\rm collar}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">α</mi></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">collar</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{\gamma\alpha}^{\rm collar}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(190.89,0) translate(0,-91.08)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -6.92 2.77" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -6.92 -2.77" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 103.79686219672107 -91.35813044696754 L 190.88840128327365 -90.80465888686739" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 190.88840128327365 -91.35813044696754 L 190.88840128327365 -90.80465888686739" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M -0.27673578005007266 -78.74949766554674 L 0.27673578005007266 -78.74949766554674" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(0,-58.35)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -2.77 -6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 2.77 -6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M -0.27673578005007266 -78.74949766554674 L 0.27673578005007266 -58.352991771579234" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M -0.27673578005007266 -58.352991771579234 L 0.27673578005007266 -58.352991771579234" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(190.89,0) translate(0,-91.08) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.58em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="21.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.Ex94.m1.pic1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 205.66820751932855 -80.93428938356165 L 206.2216790794287 -80.93428938356165" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(205.95,0) translate(0,-58.04)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -2.77 -6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 2.77 -6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 205.66820751932855 -80.93428938356165 L 206.2216790794287 -58.040088417620126" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 205.66820751932855 -58.040088417620126 L 206.2216790794287 -58.040088417620126" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g></svg></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.I22.i1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Here the commutativity of the upper square is a requirement of the collar structure. Moreover, the bottom horizontal arrow uses the splitting (<a href="#S3.E9" title="In item 2 ‣ Definition 3.28. ‣ 3.5.2. Scaffolding ‣ 3.5. Additional structures ‣ 3. Abstract constructions of chain complexes and maps over the integers ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.9</span></a>) and <math id="S3.I22.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{\gamma\alpha}^{\rm collar}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>collar</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{\gamma\alpha}^{\rm collar}</annotation></semantics></math> is the restriction to the <math id="S3.I22.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}</annotation></semantics></math> component.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I22.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="S3.I22.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I22.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The stablization maps also respect the collars. More precisely, for <math id="S3.I22.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha&lt;\beta&lt;\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha&lt;\beta&lt;\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, we require that</p>
<table id="S3.Ex95" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex95.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lx@xy@svg{\hbox{\raise 2.5pt\hbox{\kern 80.88812pt\hbox{\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\hbox{\vtop{\halign{\entry@#!@&amp;&amp;\entry@@#!@\cr&amp;&amp;\cr&amp;&amp;\crcr}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern-80.88812pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.5pt\hbox{$\textstyle{\Big({\rm Stab}_{{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}|_{\partial^{\alpha}{\mathcal{U}}_{\beta}}}(\partial^{\alpha}C_{\beta})\Big)\times[0,\epsilon)^{{\mathbb{F}}_{\alpha}\setminus{\mathbb{F}}_{\beta}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 134.88812pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-25.83275pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\kern 104.88812pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.5pt\hbox{$\textstyle{}$}}}}}}}{\hbox{\kern 134.88812pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.5pt\hbox{$\textstyle{{\rm Stab}_{{\mathcal{F}}_{\gamma\beta}}(C_{\beta})\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 165.14922pt\raise-25.75499pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\kern-43.16508pt\raise-34.74501pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.5pt\hbox{$\textstyle{\partial^{\alpha}C_{\gamma}\times[0,\epsilon