<p id="S5.SS4.SSS2.p6.3" class="ltx_p">By taking the direct sum of <math id="S5.SS4.SSS2.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\vartheta}_{prq}^{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϑ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\vartheta}_{prq}^{O}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S5.SS4.SSS2.p6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\vartheta}_{prq}^{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>ϑ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi>Q</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\vartheta}_{prq}^{Q}</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain the map</p>
