</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="S5.Thmthm62.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.Thmthm62.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Moreover, the collection of maps <math id="S5.Thmthm62.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math> satisfy the following conditions.</span></p>
<ol id="S5.I24" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S5.I24.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(1)</span> 
<div id="S5.I24.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Every fiber of </span><math id="S5.I24.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> has a canonical smooth structure and the restriction of </span><math id="S5.I24.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> to each fiber of </span><math id="S5.I24.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> has a canonical smooth bundle structure. Moreover, each </span><math id="S5.I24.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g\in G_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g\in G_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> induces diffeomorphisms between fibers and smooth bundle isomorphisms between the fiberwise restrictions of the obstruction bundles.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I24.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(2)</span> 
<div id="S5.I24.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I24.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I24.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The collection of maps </span><math id="S5.I24.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> are compatible in the following sense. For each </span><math id="S5.I24.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\alpha=pr_{1}\cdots r_{l}q\in{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\rm Floer}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mi>r</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>l</mi></msub><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>𝔸</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>Floer</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=pr_{1}\cdots r_{l}q\in{\mathbb{A}}_{pq}^{\rm Floer}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I24.i2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, the products of the projections induces a map</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex227" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex227.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\alpha}:V_{\alpha}\to B_{\delta(\alpha)}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\alpha}:V_{\alpha}\to B_{\delta(\alpha)}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.I24.i2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I24.i2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Then the following diagram commutes.</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex228" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex228.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\vbox{\lx@xy@svg{\hbox{\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\kern 15.7429pt\hbox{\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\hbox{\vtop{\halign{\entry@#!@&amp;&amp;\entry@@#!@\cr&amp;\cr&amp;\crcr}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern-9.87715pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.55554pt\hbox{$\textstyle{V_{\alpha}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 23.29848pt\raise 5.93056pt\hbox{{}\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-1.93056pt\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\vartheta_{\alpha}}$}}}\kern 3.0pt}}}}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 45.69153pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern-15.7429pt\raise-16.17805pt\hbox{{}\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-1.00694pt\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\pi_{\alpha}}$}}}\kern 3.0pt}}}}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-25.07835pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\kern 45.69153pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.55554pt\hbox{$\textstyle{\partial^{\alpha}V_{pq}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 62.49254pt\raise-16.17805pt\hbox{{}\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-0.52084pt\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\pi_{pq}}$}}}\kern 3.0pt}}}}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 62.49254pt\raise-23.03275pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\kern-14.83516pt\raise-32.35612pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.55554pt\hbox{$\textstyle{B_{\delta(\alpha)}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 19.54973pt\raise-39.08112pt\hbox{{}\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise-1.13611pt\hbox{$\scriptstyle{\zeta_{\delta(\alpha)}}$}}}\kern 3.0pt}}}}}}\ignorespaces{\hbox{\kern 38.83516pt\raise-32.35612pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\lx@xy@tip{1}\lx@xy@tip{-1}}}}}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\lx@xy@droprule}}{\hbox{\kern 38.83516pt\raise-32.35612pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 0.0pt\raise 0.0pt\hbox{\hbox{\kern 3.0pt\raise-2.55554pt\hbox{$\textstyle{\partial^{\delta(\alpha)}B_{d_{pq}}}$}}}}}}}\ignorespaces}}}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext> <svg style="vertical-align:-63.3819102911067px" height="79.79" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="21.78 63.38 140.99 79.79" width="140.99"> <g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 21.783457400146585 79.79411347799484) translate(21.78,0)"> <g transform="translate(-13.67,0) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.54)"> <foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.38em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.15em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="19.03"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></span></span></foreignObject> </g> <path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 13.667035765942819 -0.27673578005007266 L 13.667035765942819 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path> <g transform="translate(32.24,0) translat