<li id="S5.I27.ix6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(C2)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The bundle isomorphism </span><math id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> preserves the stratification. Namely, for any intermediate stratum </span><math id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> between </span><math id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="pq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">pq</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix6.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, one has</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex250" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex250.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}\left(\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{\beta}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})\right)=O_{\beta}|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{pq}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>∼</mo></msubsup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mi>α</mi></msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}\left(\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{\beta}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})\right)=O_{\beta}|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{pq}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I27.ix7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(D)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\zeta_{pq,\alpha}=\zeta_{pq,\beta}+\zeta_{\beta\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\zeta_{pq,\alpha}=\zeta_{pq,\beta}+\zeta_{\beta\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> be a point of </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{pq,\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{pq,\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> at a point </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\alpha}\in V_{\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\alpha}\in V_{\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> with respect to the splitting (</span><a href="#S5.E54" title="In item (A2) ‣ Proposition 5.64. ‣ 5.8. Constructing scaffolding ‣ 5. Global Kuranishi charts on Floer moduli spaces ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref ltx_font_italic"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.54</span></a><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">). Then the above condition (C3) implies that the bundle isomorphism </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> identifies </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\zeta_{pq,\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\zeta_{pq,\beta}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> with a vector of </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{pq,\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{pq,\beta}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> at </span><math id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{\beta}=\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{\beta\alpha})\in\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">∈</mo><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mi>α</mi></msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{\beta}=\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{\beta\alpha})\in\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">. Then we require that</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex251" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex251.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{pq,\beta}(x_{\beta},\zeta_{pq,\beta})=\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{pq,\alpha})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{pq,\beta}(x_{\beta},\zeta_{pq,\beta})=\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{pq,\alpha}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">This implies that</span></p>
<table id="S5.E55" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.E55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq,\alpha}\circ\pi_{pq,\beta}=\pi_{pq,\alpha}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq,\alpha}\circ\pi_{pq,\beta}=\pi_{pq,\alpha}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5.55)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I27.ix8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(E)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The above implies that</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex252" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex252.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})=\pi_{pq,\beta}^{*}\left(\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}^{\sim}}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>∼</mo></msubsup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>∼</mo></msubsup></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mi>α</mi></msup><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>∼</mo></msubsup></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})=\pi_{pq,\beta}^{*}\left(\pi_{pq,\alpha}^{*}(O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{V_{\alpha}^{\sim}})|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}^{\sim}}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">We require that the bundle isomorphism satisfies</span></p>
<table id="S5.E56" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.E56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}=\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\beta}^{O}\circ\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∘</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}=\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\beta}^{O}\circ\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5.56)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix8.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">More precisely, using notations in condition (D) above, the following diagram commutes.</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex253" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="78.83" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-57.11605229845544px" version="1.1" viewBox="24.44 57.12 192.49 78.83" width="192.49"><g transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 24.43844869256564 78.83245294744319) translate(0,3.54) translate(24.44,0)"><g transform="translate(-24.44,0) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.93em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.29em;font-size:10pt;" height="14.34" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="40.58"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{x_{\alpha}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{x_{\alpha}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 24.43844869256564 -0.27673578005007266 L 24.43844869256564 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(38.57,0) translate(0,10.86) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.98em;--ltx-fo-height:0.72em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.99)" width="27.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.710em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">α</mi></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(88.84,0)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -6.92 2.77" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -6.92 -2.77" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 24.43844869256564 -0.27673578005007266 L 88.83674593078689 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 88.83674593078689 -0.27673578005007266 L 88.83674593078689 0.27673578005007266" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 24.43844869256564 -9.546254834842431 L 24.43844869256564 -9.665483258581101" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(31.56,0) translate(0,-32.96) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.98em;--ltx-fo-height:0.72em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.99)" width="27.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.710em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">α</mi></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(84.8,0) translate(0,-33.21)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 -5.43 5.1" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -7.45 -0.05" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 24.43844869256564 -9.546254834842431 L 84.7999759609148 -33.208800332088" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 84.74081569115816 -33.12497939313944 L 84.7999759609148 -33.208800332088" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(88.84,0) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:2.87em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.35em;font-size:10pt;" height="15.27" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="39.73"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{x_{\beta}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{x_{\beta}}\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces\ignorespaces}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 112.57405463831378 -12.57624453951977 L 113.12752619841393 -12.57624453951977" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(112.85,0) translate(0,-22.1) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.92em;--ltx-fo-height:0.72em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.41" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.99)" width="26.56"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\beta}^{O}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">q</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.710em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.710em">β</mi></mrow><mi mathsize="0.710em">O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\scriptstyle{\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\beta}^{O}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(112.85,0) translate(0,-33.21)"><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 0 2.77 6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 0 0 A 13.84 13.84 45 0 1 -2.77 6.92" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path></g><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 112.57405463831378 -33.208800332088 L 113.12752619841393 -12.57624453951977" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><path style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;" d="M 112.57405463831378 -33.208800332088 L 113.12752619841393 -33.208800332088" fill="none" stroke="#000000"></path><g transform="translate(57.65,0) translate(0,-44.2) translate(4.15,0) translate(0,-3.54)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.38em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.38em;font-size:10pt;" height="15.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="102.11"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S5.Ex253.m1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{pq,\alpha})}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>ζ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textstyle{O_{pq}^{\infty}|_{\theta_{pq,\alpha}(x_{\alpha},\zeta_{pq,\alpha})}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I27.ix9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(F)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Given any intermediate stratum </span><math id="S5.I27.ix9.p1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\beta=ps_{1}\cdots s_{m}q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mi>s</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=ps_{1}\cdots s_{m}q</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix9.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, using the notations used in (B2), one has</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex254" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.Ex254.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}}=\widehat{\theta}_{ps_{1},\alpha_{0}}^{O}\times\cdots\times\widehat{\theta}_{s_{m}q,\alpha_{m}}^{O}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>O</mi></msup><mo fence="false" stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mo>∂</mo><mi>α</mi></msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>β</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">=</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>O</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo><mo lspace="0.055em" rspace="0.055em">⋯</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>O</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}|_{\partial^{\alpha}V_{\beta}}=\widehat{\theta}_{ps_{1},\alpha_{0}}^{O}\times\cdots\times\widehat{\theta}_{s_{m}q,\alpha_{m}}^{O}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="S5.I27.ix10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(G)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The metric on </span><math id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O_{pq}^{(d)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O_{pq}^{(d)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, the stabilization map </span><math id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{pq,\alpha}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{pq,\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, and the bundle isomorphism </span><math id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>O</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{O}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix10.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> respect collars. More precisely,</span></p>
<ol id="S5.I27.ix10.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(a)</span> 
<div id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The bundle isomorphism associated to the collar structure </span><math id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{\rm collar}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>collar</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\theta}_{pq,\alpha}^{\rm collar}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S5.I27.ix10.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> is isometric. It follows that following diagram commutes</span></p>
<table id="S5.Ex255" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
