<div id="S5.SS8.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Sketch of proof.</h6>
<div id="S5.SS8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS8.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS8.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">See Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C A proof sketch of Proposition ‣ Arnold Conjecture over Integers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>.
∎</span></p>
